Whoops, I thought I had implemented this behavior but it appears not.

In the meantime, you can loop over it explictly using iterators or indexes:

it <- trades$iterator()
while(it$hasNext()) {
   t <- it$next()
   print(t$toString())
}

or

for(i in 1:trades$size()) {
   print(trades$get(i)$toString())
}

HTH,
Alex

